  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 4.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Morning. Just put your bag down anywhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.47,
      "end_seconds": 6.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Hi. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.23,
      "end_seconds": 18.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Right, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.98,
      "end_seconds": 21.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Right, what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 22.66,
      "end_seconds": 27.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Hmm, he's been having fever and joint pains, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.25,
      "end_seconds": 32.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "So, since when have you had this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.91,
      "end_seconds": 35.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "probably two weeks yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.65,
      "end_seconds": 41.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Alright, is it constant, or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.0,
      "end_seconds": 56.38,
      "duration_seconds": 14.38,
      "text": "it, It happens every other day. I've also had a blotchy rash on the trunk, for four weeks. So, about blotchy rash on the trunk, mild, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.91,
      "end_seconds": 63.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "What about swollen painful wrists and ankles, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.95,
      "end_seconds": 77.23,
      "duration_seconds": 12.28,
      "text": "Well, yes, about the same, three weeks. With swollen painful wrists and ankles, it happens all the time. Rest helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.32,
      "end_seconds": 81.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Have you got any chronic problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.84,
      "end_seconds": 92.43,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about ten years. I've had eczema for five years now. I've got heart disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.49,
      "end_seconds": 98.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Sure. Is there a family history of anything significant?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.69,
      "end_seconds": 107.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "My sister has thyroid problems. Well, my mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.13,
      "end_seconds": 119.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Any procedures or operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.18,
      "end_seconds": 127.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "I had a stent put in my heart two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.49,
      "end_seconds": 133.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 134.4,
      "end_seconds": 138.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "It's telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.01,
      "end_seconds": 143.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "And And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 144.55,
      "end_seconds": 146.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "About about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.2,
      "end_seconds": 147.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 149.21,
      "end_seconds": 152.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "He takes hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.12,
      "end_seconds": 157.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.55,
      "end_seconds": 171.16,
      "duration_seconds": 11.61,
      "text": "I think I reacted to to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.99,
      "end_seconds": 172.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.34,
      "end_seconds": 178.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.16,
      "end_seconds": 183.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.16,
      "end_seconds": 186.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.07,
      "end_seconds": 189.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "how about exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.38,
      "end_seconds": 195.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Not really, I don't get much exercise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.23,
      "end_seconds": 197.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Do you live alone?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.33,
      "end_seconds": 205.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Yes, I live on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.04,
      "end_seconds": 212.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "have you noticed bleeding, vomiting or neck stiffness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.01,
      "end_seconds": 216.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.73,
      "end_seconds": 219.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "have you had any diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.62,
      "end_seconds": 223.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No, no diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 225.05,
      "end_seconds": 230.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "actually, doctor, I did notice diarrhoea he doesn't always say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.29,
      "end_seconds": 241.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.74,
      "text": "I mean, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.16,
      "end_seconds": 253.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Have you noticed red eyes or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.83,
      "end_seconds": 259.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "No red eyes or cough, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.43,
      "end_seconds": 262.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.33,
      "end_seconds": 264.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "no changes there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.15,
      "end_seconds": 269.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Okay, a quick examination now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.64,
      "end_seconds": 272.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.78,
      "end_seconds": 284.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Both wrists and several finger joints are puffy and tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.6,
      "end_seconds": 288.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "let me look at this properly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.53,
      "end_seconds": 308.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "A fine rash over the chest and back, not itchy to touch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.83,
      "end_seconds": 317.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Okay, thanks, please take a seat again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.81,
      "end_seconds": 339.82,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably a viral fever with joint involvement, possibly chikungunya. An early inflammatory arthritis is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.55,
      "end_seconds": 344.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.02,
      "end_seconds": 354.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a viral fever with joint involvement, possibly chikungunya do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.22,
      "end_seconds": 387.16,
      "duration_seconds": 17.94,
      "text": "I'll request a full blood count, it'll help with fever. I want a dengue test done, that's for fever. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'll request a chikungunya test, it'll help with fever with joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.62,
      "end_seconds": 391.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "okay, you know, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.23,
      "end_seconds": 409.59,
      "duration_seconds": 17.36,
      "text": "You'll be taking paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for five days. You take it it by mouth. It's for fever and joint pain. Avoid anti-inflammatory painkillers until we know it isn't dengue. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.52,
      "end_seconds": 416.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "okay, you know, so no, you've explained it well thanks"
    }
  ]
}